  "body": "**Set on a large 780m² section, Lot 132 backs onto a bush reserve, offering beautiful rural views while being conveniently close to SH1, Orewa and all local amenities.**\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern living, this four-bedroom home combines light timber and feature plaster for striking street appeal. Upstairs, three generous double bedrooms include a spacious master suite with its own private deck and stunning bush views, alongside a family bathroom. Downstairs, a separate bedroom with ensuite offers flexibility for guests or extended family, while a dedicated office and separate WC add everyday functionality. At the heart of the home, the open-plan kitchen with butler’s pantry flows into a generous living area and out to the bush-facing deck – perfect for relaxed living and entertaining.\r\n\r\n**Looking for something uniquely yours? We can custom-design your dream home to suit your lifestyle & vision in Ara Hills. Contact the Signature Homes team today to explore your options and bring your new home to life.**\r\n\r\nSet within the growing Ara Hills community in Orewa, this is an ideal location for those seeking modern living with nature on their doorstep. Surrounded by green spaces, walking and cycling trails, and with easy access to Orewa Beach, local schools, shops and cafés, Ara Hills offers the perfect balance of lifestyle and convenience. With motorway access nearby, commuting to the wider North Shore and Auckland is easy, while everything Orewa has to offer is just minutes from home.\r\n\r\n**House & Land features:**\r\n- Bush reserve views\r\n- Four generous double bedrooms\r\n- Striking light timber & feature plaster exterior\r\n- Master suite with private deck & bush views\r\n- Separate downstairs bedroom with ensuite \r\n- Dedicated home office & separate WC\r\n- Open-plan kitchen with generous butler’s pantry\r\n- Spacious living area flowing onto a bush-facing deck\r\n- Designed for easy entertaining & relaxed family living\r\n- Market-leading Guarantees, including 2 years of maintenance cover",
